00:03:26,600 --> 00:03:39,280
So this is what it means when you have credit in your phone. It means that you have some money with the telephone company. So when you make a call, they discount it from there. But if you don't have any more credit, you can't make any phone calls.

56
00:03:39,280 --> 00:03:42,440
Exactly. So basically credit represents money.

57
00:03:42,880 --> 00:03:43,120
